        html: '\n<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">\n<div class="max-w-4xl"><p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-700">Before Requesting a Quote</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Define the Solid Ribbon, Grid Layout and Joint Details Before Quotation</h2><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Solid MMO ribbon is selected as part of an electrical grid or distributed-anode layout. Width and thickness matter, but the project also needs a stated linear-output basis, conductor-bar arrangement and controlled joint details.</p></div>\n<div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">\n<article class="rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-6 sm:p-8"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">What we review before manufacture</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span><span>Confirm that solid ribbon—not expanded mesh ribbon—is required.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span><span>Define width, thickness, total length, active zones and coil or cut-length supply.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span><span>State output per unit length with electrolyte, temperature and operating assumptions.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span><span>Provide grid spacing, conductor-bar arrangement, feed points and allowable voltage drop.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span><span>Agree joint method, inspection, packaging and installation-document requirements.</span></li></ul></article>\n<article class="rounded-3xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-6 sm:p-8"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">What the product specification cannot replace</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span><span>Solid ribbon and mesh ribbon are not interchangeable descriptions.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span><span>A nominal ribbon size does not establish grid output or design life.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span><span>Field layout, joint execution and energization checks must be assigned to the responsible project party.</span></li></ul></article>\n</div>\n\n<div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 sm:p-8"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Related anode options</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">Compare the adjacent product families only after the reaction, environment and supply boundary are clear.</p><nav class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3" aria-label="Related anode products"><a href="/titanium-anode/mmo-anode/mmo-mesh-ribbon-anode" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-blue-800 transition hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-950 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:ring-offset-2">MMO Mesh Ribbon Anodes</a><a href="/titanium-anode/mmo-anode/mmo-linear-anode" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-blue-800 transition hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-950 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:ring-offset-2">MMO Linear Anodes</a><a href="/titanium-anode/mmo-anode/mmo-wire-anode" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-blue-800 transition hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-950 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:ring-offset-2">MMO Wire Anodes</a><a href="/titanium-anode/mmo-anode/mmo-canister-anode" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-blue-800 transition hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-950 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:ring-offset-2">MMO Canister Anodes</a><a href="/titanium-anode/mmo-anode" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-blue-800 transition hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-950 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:ring-offset-2">All MMO Anode Forms</a></nav></div>\n</div>\n',
