        html: '\n  <div data-mmo-container="page" class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr] lg:items-center">\n    <div><p class="text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-white">Inside our factory</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-white">Inside Our Manufacturing &amp; Quality System</h2><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-white">We review the titanium tube material and dimensions, active coated zone, end construction, cable connection and seal against the approved technical schedule. Where required, the order package can define continuity, connection, dimensional, coating and final visual checks.</p>\n      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">\n        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-white">1. Material Identity</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-white">Confirm titanium form, grade or order standard, dimensions and material evidence against the purchase specification.</p></div>\n        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-white">2. Coating &amp; Active Zone</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-white">Control the coating direction and active geometry to the agreed production basis; do not infer life from appearance alone.</p></div>\n        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-white">3. Connection &amp; Assembly</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-white">Review electrical joints, cable or conductor interfaces, sealing and mechanical details included in our supply scope.</p></div>\n        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-white">4. Final Release</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-white">Verify dimensions, identification, visual condition, packing and the agreed inspection or document package before shipment.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class="mt-7 text-sm leading-6 text-white">Sampling, acceptance values, test methods and supplied records are finalized in the quotation, inspection plan or approved order documents.</p>\n    </div>\n    <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5"><img src="/images/titanium-anode/mmo-tubular-anode-mmo-tubular-anode-hele1.webp" alt="MMO Tubular Anode manufacturing and inspection reference" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="600"><figcaption class="p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-white">Inspection scope is matched to the ordered product and agreed evidence package.</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n',
